1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:04,073
(Sheldon:)Correction.
Missy can date whoever she wants.

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,370
- Look, we have to settle this.
- I agree.

3
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:12,163
(Leonard:)Sheldon's sister is hiding at Penny's
because we've all been hitting on her.

4
00:00:12,328 --> 00:00:16,628
She's not hiding. She needed to call her
grandmother, who's apparently very sick.

5
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:19,541
(Raj:)Oh, and then I believe
she has to wash her hair.

6
00:00:20,253 --> 00:00:22,793
(Howard:)Oh, you poor deluded bastard.

7
00:00:22,964 --> 00:00:25,174
- Don't start with me, dude.
- You wanna go again?

8
00:00:25,341 --> 00:00:27,301
(Missy:)- Sit down.
- Okay.

9
00:00:28,136 --> 00:00:30,846
If we're gonna fight over Missy,
let's do it the right way.

10
00:00:31,014 --> 00:00:32,514
The honorable way.

11
00:00:32,724 --> 00:00:33,934
HOWARD:
Ow! Ow, ow, ow.

12
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,850
LEONARD:
Take that.

13
00:00:36,019 --> 00:00:37,729
You want some more?

14
00:00:40,064 --> 00:00:41,944
(Leonard:)And he's down.

15
00:00:42,108 --> 00:00:45,738
MAN [ON TV]:
One, two, three, four...

16
00:00:45,903 --> 00:00:48,443
- Come on, come on! Get up.
- Stay down, bitch.

17
00:00:48,614 --> 00:00:52,204
Seven, eight, nine, 10.

18
00:00:52,368 --> 00:00:53,788
[BELL DINGS ON TV]

19
00:00:53,953 --> 00:00:56,333
Yeah! Natural selection at work.

20
00:00:56,497 --> 00:00:58,787
(Sheldon:)I weep for humanity.

